                                                                                             "A role of an agent who borrows funds or resources under a regulatory framework." ,
                                                                                             "An individual who is or was a student and who is receiving, or who has received, British Columbia Student Financial Assistance, Canada Student Financial Assistance, or Student Financial Assistance as outlined in the Master Student Financial Assistance Agreement, to attend studies at a Designated Post-Secondary Institution." ;
                                            <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00819> .


