                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Compulsory fees include annual admission fees required when submitting applications, student council fees, student services fees, field trip costs (excluding transportation cost as outlined in Chapter 2, Section 3), examination fees, graduate thesis costs and other amounts payable by the student to the educational institution that are obligatory in connection with their course of study. They may include fees payable for membership in professional or other societies where required." ;
                                                  <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00822> .


