###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#FinancialNeedAssessment
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#FinancialNeedAssessment> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                           rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> ;
                                                           rdfs:label "Financial Need Assessment" ;
                                                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Financial need for part-time studies is determined based on an assessment of allowable educational costs, including tuition, books/supplies, miscellaneous allowance, transportation allowance, and child care costs." ;
