###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#LateContinuation
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#LateContinuation> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                    rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Condition> ;
                                                    rdfs:label "Late Continuation" ;
