###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#MutuallyExclusiveCourses
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#MutuallyExclusiveCourses> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                            rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> ;
                                                            rdfs:label "Mutually Exclusive Courses" ;
                                                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Courses that have a different course name and number but have the same content as another course. Students who are taking duplicate or mutually exclusive courses will not be granted credit for a second time and the duplicate course will not be counted when determining a student’s course load of study for StudentAid BC purposes." ;
                                                            <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00844> .


