                                                             rdfs:subClassOf :AcademicWithdrawalResourcePattern ,
                                                                             <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> ;
                                                             rdfs:label "Non-Punitive Withdrawal Form" ;
                                                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A form used to report non-punitive withdrawals from a study period to StudentAid BC." .


###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#NonRepayableFinancialAssistance
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#NonRepayableFinancialAssistance> rdf:type owl:Class ;
