###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#ParentLivingOutsideCanada
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#ParentLivingOutsideCanada> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                             rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Role> ;
                                                             rdfs:label "Parent Living Outside Canada" ;
