###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#ParentalExpectedContribution
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#ParentalExpectedContribution> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> .


###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#ParentalExpectedContributionFromAssets
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#ParentalExpectedContributionFromAssets> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                          rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> ;
                                                                          rdfs:label "Parental Expected Contribution from Assets" ;
                                                                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The calculated amount a parent is expected to contribute from their assets, determined as one percent of the total net value of all eligible assets (excluding RRSPs, motor vehicles, principal residence and business/farm), in excess of a standard exemption of $150,000, divided by the number of the parents’ dependants who are attending post-secondary studies." ;
                                                                          <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00437> .


###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#ParentalIncomeReportingCalculation
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#ParentalIncomeReportingCalculation> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                      rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> ;
                                                                      rdfs:label "Parental Income Reporting Calculation" ;
                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A calculation rule defining how parents living outside Canada must report their income and assets on Appendix 1, including conditional logic for unfiled Canadian tax returns." ;
                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00432> .


###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#ParentalLivingAllowance
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#ParentalLivingAllowance> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                           rdfs:subClassOf :FinancialNeedAssessmentInputPattern ,
                                                                           <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> ;
                                                           rdfs:label "Parental Living Allowance" ;
                                                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsAvailableIncome> ,
                                                                                                            <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContribution> ;
                                                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A moderate standard of living allowance set by the Government of Canada that is a measure of the cost of living that includes shelter, food, miscellaneous expenses and transportation, and takes into account family size. This amount is used in calculating the contribution parents are expected to make towards a dependant student’s education expenses." ;
                                                           <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00853> .


