###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#PartTimeLoanOrGrantFunding
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#PartTimeLoanOrGrantFunding> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                              rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> ;
