                                                          rdfs:label "Part-Time Student Funding" ;
                                                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Financial assistance funding available to part-time students under the Canada Student Financial Assistance Program." .


###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#PartTimeStudentLoanApplication
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#PartTimeStudentLoanApplication> rdf:type owl:Class ;
