###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#PersistentOrProlongedDisability
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/ca#PersistentOrProlongedDisability> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                   rdfs:subClassOf :FunctionalImpairmentPattern ,
                                                                                   <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Role> ;
