                                                                                                                 <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#RepeatedTraining> ;
                                                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Periods of training required for professional licensing or accreditation after the granting of a formal credential (internship, articling, etc.)." .


