                                                                                                            "A contract of apprenticeship under which an apprentice is employed to learn a trade or profession." ,
                                                                                                            "A contract of employment or a written statement of particulars under the Employment Rights Act 1996, which takes the form of an apprenticeship agreement." ,
                                                                                                            "A document constituting the apprenticeship agreement" ,
                                                                                                            "A formal agreement between an employer and an apprentice governing the terms of the apprenticeship" ,
                                                                                                            "A formal agreement between an employer and an apprentice outlining the terms of the apprenticeship" ,
                                                                                                            "A formal agreement between the apprentice and the employer outlining the terms of the apprenticeship." ,
                                                                                                            "A formal agreement governing an apprenticeship programme." ,
                                                                                                            "This is defined in section A1(3) of the Apprenticeships, Skills, Children and Learning Act 2009 (as amended by the Enterprise Act 2016) and the Apprenticeships (Miscellaneous Provisions) Regulations 2017." ;
                                                           <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00260> .


