                                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A statement required from an employer attesting to the apprentice's competency." ,
                                                                                                                "A statement required from an employer confirming the competency of an apprentice." .


###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerDefinedTerm
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerDefinedTerm> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                       rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Role> ;
                                                       rdfs:label "Employer" ;
                                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "This can include a Flexi-Job Apprenticeship Agency (FJAA). This may also include a company or charity whose PAYE scheme the employer has connected to their apprenticeship service account. References to an ‘employer’ describe the whole organisation, not individual sites, locations, groups, or companies linked by directors." ,
                                                                                                        "We use the term ‘employer’ to mean an organisation that has a contract of service and an apprenticeship agreement with an apprentice." ;
                                                       <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00032> ,
                                                                                                  <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_01199> .


