<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerIncentivePayment> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                            rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> ;
                                                            rdfs:label "Employer Incentive Payment" ;
                                                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A payment generated when a foundation apprenticeship attracts an employer incentive, as identified on the Skills England website." .


###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerMentoringCost
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerMentoringCost> rdf:type owl:Class ;
