                                                         rdfs:label "Employer Mentoring Cost" ;
                                                         <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Costs of an employer supporting or mentoring an apprentice, where this is required by the standard and part of the agreed training plan." .


###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerNonLevyPayer
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerNonLevyPayer> rdf:type owl:Class ;
