                                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Employers who do not pay the apprenticeship levy, and levy paying employers with insufficient funds, as defined in UK apprenticeship funding regulations." .


###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerOrProviderRole
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#EmployerOrProviderRole> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                          rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Role> ;
                                                          rdfs:label "Employer or Provider Role" ;
