###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#LearningSupportFunding
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#LearningSupportFunding> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                          rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> ;
                                                          rdfs:label "Learning Support Funding" ;
                                                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A fixed monthly funding allocation for learning support, set at £150 per month." ,
                                                                                                           "Financial resources allocated to support learners with additional needs, claimed through ILR and EAS systems." ,
                                                                                                           "Funding allocated to providers for delivering reasonable adjustments to learners, claimed monthly and subject to evidence requirements." ,
                                                                                                           "Funding allocated to support apprentices with learning difficulties or disabilities." ,
                                                                                                           "Funding available to meet the costs incurred by a provider of putting in place reasonable adjustments for an apprentice, as set out in section 20 of the Equality Act 2010." ;
                                                          <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00133> .


