###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#PeripheralCosts
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#PeripheralCosts> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                   rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> ;
                                                   rdfs:label "Peripheral Costs" ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Peripheral costs associated with a mandatory qualification. These include registration, formative on-programme assessment costs, examination and certification costs, plus the cost of one re-sit (per mandatory qualification) where needed." ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00448> .


