###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#RedundantApprentice
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#RedundantApprentice> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                       rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Agent> ,
                                                                       <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Person> ;
