                                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An apprentice whose apprenticeship agreement has been terminated by reason of redundancy, who on the day of dismissal has completed less than 75% of the apprenticeship practical period and whose remaining training represents a duration of six months or more." ;
                                                       <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00927> .


