                                                 rdfs:label "Subcontractor" ;
                                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A role for a party that enters into a subcontract with a primary provider to deliver part of the services." ,
                                                                                                  "A role for entities engaged by a provider to assist in the delivery of apprenticeship funded training." ,
                                                                                                  "A role held by an entity that performs work or provides services under a contract with a primary provider." ,
                                                                                                  "A role of a party that has entered into a subcontract with a provider." ,
                                                                                                  "An organisation acting as a subcontractor in the delivery of services." ,
                                                                                                  "An organisation contracted by a provider to deliver part of the apprenticeship training or assessment." ,
                                                                                                  "An organisation engaged by a provider to deliver part of the provision." ,
                                                                                                  "An organisation or an individual (not an employee) that is contracted by a provider for the delivery of training and on-programme assessment, as part of the employer’s agreed apprenticeship programme." ,
                                                                                                  "An organisation that delivers apprenticeship training under a subcontracting arrangement with a main provider." ;
                                                 <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00030> .


