###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#NotaryPublic
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#NotaryPublic> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Role> ;
                                                rdfs:label "Notary Public" ;
                                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A role of a person authorized to perform certain legal formalities, especially to witness signatures on documents." .


###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsAvailableIncome
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsAvailableIncome> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                          rdfs:subClassOf :FinancialNeedAssessmentInputPattern ,
                                                                          <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> ;
                                                          rdfs:label "Parents' Available Income" ;
                                                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Parents' available income is calculated by subtracting certain allowances from the parents' total income. These allowances account for certain nondiscretionary expenses, such as taxes and basic living expenses. Once a minimum level of support has been offset for those expenses, the formula assumes that the remaining income is available for discretionary purposes, including paying for a postsecondary education. The available income can be a negative number." ;
                                                          <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00179> .


###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContribution
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContribution> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                       rdfs:subClassOf :FinancialNeedAssessmentInputPattern ,
                                                                       <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> ;
                                                       rdfs:label "Parents' Contribution" ;
                                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The calculated amount representing the portion of parental income and assets considered available to help pay for the student's college education, as determined under the 2025-26 Student Aid Index (SAI) and Pell Grant Eligibility Guide." ;
                                                       <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00184> .


###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContributionFromAssets
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContributionFromAssets> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                 rdfs:subClassOf :FinancialNeedAssessmentInputPattern ,
                                                                                 <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> ;
                                                                 rdfs:label "Parents Contribution from Assets" ;
                                                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A calculated amount representing the contribution from the assets of parents of a dependent student, determined by adding cash, savings, checking, time deposits, money market funds, net worth of investments, and adjusted net worth of business and/or investment farm." .


###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsTotalIncome
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsTotalIncome> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                      rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> ;
                                                      rdfs:label "Parents Total Income" ;
                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The total income of parents as calculated for student aid purposes, subject to offsets and allowances defined in regulation." ;
                                                      <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00181> .


