                                                          <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00300> .


###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#PertinentFinancialInformation
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#PertinentFinancialInformation> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                 rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> ;
