###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#PrepaidTuitionPlan
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#PrepaidTuitionPlan> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                      rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> ;
                                                      rdfs:label "Prepaid Tuition Plan" ;
                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Prepaid tuition plans allow a person to buy tuition credits or certificates, which count as units of attendance. They are an asset of the plan owner, and their worth is the refund value of the credits or certificates." ;
                                                      <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00097> .


