                                                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A temporary status assigned to a student who claims unusual circumstances and does not provide parental data on the FAFSA, pending further review." .


###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ProvisionalSAICalculation
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ProvisionalSAICalculation> rdf:type owl:Class ;
