###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#StudentAidIndex
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#StudentAidIndex> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                   rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Resource> ;
                                                   rdfs:label "Student Aid Index" ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The Student Aid Index (SAI) is a calculated value representing a student's financial need for postsecondary education, determined by adding available income and contribution from assets, then applying progressive rates from Table C6 (22% to 47%) as adjusted available income increases." ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00208> .


