                                                                                                           "The student's available income, calculated by subtracting certain allowances from the student's total income." ;
                                                          <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00186> ,
                                                                                                     <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00189> .


###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#StudentContributionFromIncome
