                                                                                                                  "The student's contribution from income, calculated by multiplying the student's (and spouse's) available income by the assessment rate of 50%, which may be a negative number." ;
                                                                 <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00189> ,
                                                                                                            <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00197> .


