                                                                     <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasConditionExpression> "BCAG-FT Award = Weekly Grant Amount × Study Period Weeks. Maximum weekly amounts: $29.41 (single independent, income $30,000, program ≥2 years) or $117.65 (independent, family of 4, income $62,000, program <2 years)." ;
