                                                                <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasConditionExpression> "Students who withdraw from course(s) are not eligible for APSD funding again unless they can supply medical documentation confirming they withdrew for medical reasons. Other exceptional circumstances may be accepted at the discretion of the Accessibility Coordinator at B.C. public post-secondary institutions or StudentAid BC for B.C. private post-secondary institutions." ;
