###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00381_action_700771
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00381_action_700771> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                     owl:Thing ,
                                                                     <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Action> ;
                                                            <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasActionExpression> "Delivered or arranged for the delivery of off-the-job training. Planned for OTJT active learning to take place every calendar month (every 3 calendar months for front-loaded and block release models) and a break in learning has been used where there was no plan. Where relevant, been approved by the relevant regulatory body before delivering apprenticeship training and there is evidence of this approval. Documented the actual volume of off-the-job training hours on the ILR when the learner exits the apprenticeship (completers and early leavers) and ensured that this value is supported by proof of delivery. All delivery evidence must be quantifiable and must meet the definition given in paragraphs 77 and 78. No ineligible activities (see paragraph 79) have been included. The evidence should include a broad description of the activity or the session it relates to (e.g. subject title or module / lesson number) to enable a cross-check against the training plan." ;
                                                            rdfs:label "Deliver and Document Training" ;
                                                            <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00381> .


