###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00545_action_9000af
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00545_action_9000af> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                     owl:Thing ,
                                                                     <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Action> ;
                                                            <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasActionExpression> "confirmation of eligibility for any additional payment and / or care leaver bursary" ;
                                                            rdfs:label "Confirmation of Eligibility" ;
                                                            <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00545> .


###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00545_condition_cef982
<https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00545_condition_cef982> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                        owl:Thing ,
                                                                        <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#Condition> ;
                                                               <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasConditionExpression> "Before any payment is claimed for and paid there is confirmation of eligibility for any additional payment and / or care leaver bursary. This includes (1) confirmation of age; (2) a signed letter or email confirmation from a local authority confirming the individual’s care leaver status (this does not require a particular format); or (3) evidence of an education, health and care (EHC) plan where the apprentice is aged between 19 and 24 years old (Local Authority confirmation does not require a particular format; main providers should assist the apprentice in obtaining confirmation where necessary)." ;
                                                               rdfs:label "Pre-Payment Condition" ;
                                                               <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#UK_UNIT_00545> .


