                                                                <https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasConditionExpression> "if any of the following is true: The student's parent is a single parent and has an AGI less than or equal to 325% of the poverty guideline for the applicant's family size and state of residence; or The student's parent is not a single parent and has an AGI less than or equal to 275% of the poverty guideline for the applicant's family size and state of residence." ;
